Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 04:54:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Expose DATUM template creator names for any pool

Detect the DATUM coinbase layout (pooled unique-id push, primary 0x0F secondary 0x00 tag push) structurally instead of gating on the OCEAN pool name.
